### Data Read (8)
- `GET /backend-api/charts-storage/1.1/{1.1Id}` — Retrieve chart storage data by ID.
- `GET /backend-api/chronos/api/v1/candles` — Retrieve historical candle data for a financial instrument.
- `GET /backend-api/user/me` — Get the agent's own user profile.
- `GET /backend-api/user/me/{meId}` — Get the agent's own user profile information.
- `GET /backend-api/user/me/quick-transfer/status` — Check the status of a quick transfer.
- `GET /backend-api/user/me/reports/trades-for-chart` — Get trade reports for a specific chart.
- `GET /kerber-api/v1/accounts` — Retrieve account information.
- `GET /sdk/v2/{v2Id}` — Retrieve data using a specific SDK version.

### Data Write (1)
- `POST /2/httpapi` — Post data to the HTTP API.

### Config (2)
- `GET /v1alpha/projects/-/apps/1:769388975317:web:3bebb5593c4dc9fb007e5c/webConfig` — Get web application configuration.
- `POST /flags/` — Retrieve feature flag configurations.

### Core API (1)
- `GET /` — Access the core API.

